  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Outlast is a durable, control-oriented co-polyester monofilament designed for consistent all-court performance and exceptional tension stability. Its high-powered polymer construction provides strong durability while retaining responsive touch and predictable control. Outlast is one of the strongest beneficiaries of Solinco's TruTension Technology and is positioned as one of the brand's best options for players seeking long-lasting tension maintenance and reliable playability.",

    "zh": "Solinco Outlast 是一款强调耐久、控制和全场稳定表现的共聚酯单丝球线。其高性能聚酯结构在提供出色耐久性的同时，依然保留良好的响应手感和可预测控制。Outlast 是 TruTension™ Technology 受益最明显的 Solinco 球线之一，核心优势就是超强保磅和长期稳定可打性，非常适合希望减少频繁换线、同时保持稳定线床反馈的球员。"
  },

